  "name": "Warrior of the Gods",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/light/explosion-beam-impact-silhouette.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A divine entity helps ensure you can continue the fight. You have a pool of four d12s that you can spend to heal yourself. As a Bonus Action, you can expend dice from the pool, roll them, and regain a number of Hit Points equal to the roll's total.</p><p>Your pool regains all expended dice when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>The pool's maximum number of dice increases by one when you reach Barbarian levels 6 (5 dice), 12 (6 dice), and 17 (7 dice).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-er80mQOJaHK8ww7M\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The pool size is automatically handled in this feature's scale value advancement.</p></section>",
